WEBVTT

00:08:30.172 --> 00:08:33.300
There is an infinity
of applications possible.

00:08:34.009 --> 00:08:35.886
There is no company,

00:08:35.886 --> 00:08:40.766
no industry that cannot derive
significant climate impact

00:08:40.766 --> 00:08:43.018
from the use of artificial intelligence.

00:08:43.644 --> 00:08:47.648
I’m not saying artificial intelligence
alone will save us.

00:08:48.607 --> 00:08:50.943
But artificial intelligence,

00:08:50.943 --> 00:08:54.029
by helping us measure accurately,

00:08:54.029 --> 00:08:55.197
simulate

00:08:55.197 --> 00:08:57.241
and optimize,

00:08:57.241 --> 00:09:01.036
enables significant emissions reduction